<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Draw me, we will run after Thee;</l><l>Let us see if the vine has budded,</l><l>If the pomegranates are in bloom;</l><l>There I will give You my love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
